  "Overview": "The evil Zargon has captured Being's friends and the magical star pieces. Somehow this will enable him to rule the galaxy, so Being has to stop him.\n\nBeing is a traditional side-scrolling platformer. The player character can move horizontally, jump on platforms, collect coins as well as keys. The latter are required to open same-colored doors. Enemies can't be defeated and have to be avoided, otherwise one of the three hearts of life energy is removed. At the end of a level waits one of Being's friends and a star piece to collect.",
